  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Accountability for and Audit of Disaster-Related Aid</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objectives:  This grant will support certain selected activities of the INTOSAI Task Force so as to help establish a comprehensive audit trail of aid flows for disaster related aid, which could then be utilized to enhance accountability for disaster aid and also be used by the other INTOSAI work group to develop audit guidelines. This work will take into consideration weak capacities on the ground and the challenges of coordinating accountability trails across international borders. The work will be carried out against the specific context of Indonesia as a country receiving tsunami aid.  The work will help develop insights into the aid flows in Indonesia to identify what kinds of audit trails are practical and what are not in such circumstances.</narrative>
  </description>
